# The native app idle and alive (tools/run loop): run with --live through SDL's own loop. Once the
# view's first paint (2.6 s) is over, the pointer onto a's number box wakes it (a frame with the
# row lit), the tip's 400 ms rest wakes it again (a frame with the tip), then nothing happens for
# 5.4 s, while tools/run loop samples the process (ps over 3 s, a stack with `sample`) from 1 s
# after the shot; leaving the box for the plane wakes it once more. Positions at 1440 x 900: a's
# box is (330, 408.5, 107, 32), the plane right of x 488, its empty background at (700, 700)
# (tools/src/loop.py's PLANE: no mark there to take hold of).
size 1440 900
density 2
wait 3000
move 383 424
wait 1000
shot awake
wait 5400
move 700 700
wait 600
shot awake-again
wait 200
